{
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "slug": "accordion",
  "title": "Accordion",
  "group": "Data display",
  "order": 8,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A stack of questions or sections, each opening its panel on a spring. For content people read selectively; never to hide what everyone needs.",
    "id": "Tumpukan pertanyaan atau bagian yang masing-masing membuka panelnya dengan spring. Untuk isi yang dibaca sebagian saja; jangan pernah untuk menyembunyikan hal yang dibutuhkan semua orang."
  },
  "titleId": "Accordion",
  "react": true,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Questions, one open at a time",
        "desc": "With `data-lds-accordion=\"single\"` opening one closes the other.",
        "html": "<div class=\"acc\" data-lds-accordion=\"single\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" id=\"faq1-b\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq1\">Can I change my queue slot after booking?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel is-open\" id=\"faq1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq1-b\"><div><p>Yes, up to one day before the visit. On the day itself, ask the Disdukcapil counter in Way Halim.</p></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" id=\"faq2-b\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq2\">Where do I find my new family card (KK)?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"faq2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq2-b\"><div><p>Under Documents, then Population records. You can download it as a PDF with a QR code.</p></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" id=\"faq3-b\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq3\">What happens if I miss my e-KTP recording?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"faq3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq3-b\"><div><p>Book a new slot. Recording also opens every Saturday at the Kedaton district office.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Two-line titles and rich content",
        "desc": "`.acc__title` with `.acc__sub`, and `.acc__content` for a list and an action. Several can be open.",
        "html": "<div class=\"acc acc--fill\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"sec1\"><span class=\"acc__title\">Step 1: documents to bring<span class=\"acc__sub\">4 documents · checked at the counter</span></span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"sec1\" role=\"region\"><div><div class=\"acc__content\"><p>Bring the originals; copies are made at the counter.</p><ul><li>Cover letter from your RT/RW.</li><li>Family card (KK) and old ID card.</li></ul><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" style=\"align-self: flex-start;\">See the full checklist</button></div></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"sec2\"><span class=\"acc__title\">Step 2: pay the fee<span class=\"acc__sub\">Free · no counter payment</span></span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"sec2\" role=\"region\"><div><div class=\"acc__content\"><p>Population documents are free of charge. Report any request for payment through the complaint channel.</p></div></div></div></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Pertanyaan, satu terbuka sekaligus",
        "desc": "Dengan `data-lds-accordion=\"single\"`, membuka satu butir menutup butir lain.",
        "html": "<div class=\"acc\" data-lds-accordion=\"single\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" id=\"faq1-b\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq1\">Bisakah saya mengubah jadwal antrean setelah mendaftar?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel is-open\" id=\"faq1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq1-b\"><div><p>Bisa, paling lambat sehari sebelum kedatangan. Pada hari itu, tanyakan ke loket Disdukcapil di Way Halim.</p></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" id=\"faq2-b\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq2\">Di mana saya menemukan KK baru saya?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"faq2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq2-b\"><div><p>Di menu Dokumen, lalu Data kependudukan. Anda bisa mengunduhnya sebagai PDF ber-QR code.</p></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" id=\"faq3-b\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq3\">Bagaimana jika saya terlewat jadwal perekaman e-KTP?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"faq3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq3-b\"><div><p>Pesan jadwal baru. Perekaman juga dibuka setiap Sabtu di kantor Kecamatan Kedaton.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Judul dua baris dan isi kaya",
        "desc": "`.acc__title` dengan `.acc__sub`, dan `.acc__content` untuk daftar dan aksi. Beberapa butir bisa terbuka bersamaan.",
        "html": "<div class=\"acc acc--fill\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"sec1\"><span class=\"acc__title\">Langkah 1: dokumen yang dibawa<span class=\"acc__sub\">4 dokumen · diperiksa di loket</span></span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"sec1\" role=\"region\"><div><div class=\"acc__content\"><p>Bawa dokumen asli; fotokopi dibuat di loket.</p><ul><li>Surat pengantar RT/RW.</li><li>KK dan KTP lama.</li></ul><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" style=\"align-self: flex-start;\">Lihat daftar lengkap</button></div></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"sec2\"><span class=\"acc__title\">Langkah 2: biaya<span class=\"acc__sub\">Gratis · tanpa bayar di loket</span></span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"sec2\" role=\"region\"><div><div class=\"acc__content\"><p>Dokumen kependudukan tidak dipungut biaya. Laporkan permintaan uang lewat kanal pengaduan.</p></div></div></div></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "reactUsage": "import { AccordionItem } from 'lampung-design-system/react';\n\n<div className=\"acc\">\n  <AccordionItem title=\"Step 1: documents to bring\" sub=\"4 documents · checked at the counter\" defaultOpen>\n    <p>Bring the originals; copies are made at the counter.</p>\n  </AccordionItem>\n</div>",
